YOMryQf4JLg&oe=6ABFA889"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "634577291814563", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982593_634577295147896_4258915715040137912_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9f8T5l0bCxQQ7kNvwHccRAR&_nc_oc=AdojHrM01N5vdv6RpwjXHBY9pQLcInnbZxz2OmS-DC57dtGZKksGv2KUdmAmi-lMd0o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQP1UC62Zn5x-R7qrCT0d_SaJB9knC_r8ivSPdK4zKv3UQ&oe=6ABFB103"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bike Attack Race - Bike Racing Game", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Bike Attack Race is an offline stunt bike racing game where you can become the ultimate street bike warrior. Race against rival bikers on dangerous tracks, perform death-defying stunts, and shoot down anyone who gets in your way. Choose from a variety of bikes and tracks to challenge yourself.\n\nIn Bike Attack Race , you will:\n- Shoot your opponents with a variety of weapons, including pistols, shotguns, machine guns, and even rocket launchers, to slow them down or eliminate them from the race.\n- Choose from a variety of bikes, each with its own unique stats and abilities. Some bikes are better for speed, while others are better for handling.\n- Race on different tracks with different challenges, such as narrow paths, obstacles, traps, and even other vehicles.\n- Collect power-ups to help you win the race, such as speed boosts, health boosts, weapon upgrades.\n- Unlock new bikes and tracks as you progress through the game.\nCompete against other AI players from around the world.\n- Bike Attack Race is a fun and challenging game that is sure to appeal to fans of bike attack racing games. The game is free to download and play, but there are in-app purchases available.\n\nHere are some of the features that make Bike Attack Race unique:\n- Stunning graphics\n- Realistic physics\n- Varied gameplay\n- Customization options\n\nIf you are looking for a fun and challenging stunt 